### LinkPulse Analytics API Examples (VS Code REST Client format)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@linkId = clzlink0000108l8d1e2f3g4
@campaignId = clzcamp000108l8a1b2c3d1

### 1. Get analytics summary (default 30d period, bot clicks excluded)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/summary

### 2. Get analytics summary with custom period and bot traffic included
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/summary?period=7d&includeBots=true

### 3. Get analytics summary for a specific link
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/summary?linkId={{linkId}}

### 4. Get timeseries metrics (daily bucketing with gap filling)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/timeseries?period=30d

### 5. Get timeseries with custom date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/timeseries?from=2026-09-20T00:00:00.000Z&to=2026-10-20T23:59:59.999Z

### 6. Get device, browser, and referrer breakdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/breakdown?period=30d

### 7. Get top performing links by click volume
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/top-links?limit=5

### 8. Get campaign performance analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/campaigns

### 9. Get link health alerts (expiring soon, click limits, traffic spikes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/alerts

### 10. Get plain-English automated analytics insights
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/insights?period=30d
